# ADAMAS reference database (part M, v0.35.0 and later): sources added for the Entanglement Lab (adamas/entangle.py) and build phases P7 and P8 (shewhart1931, mankins1995); and, from v0.40.0, the published price and rate pages behind the Machines and Facilities Atlas (adamas.atlas_prices), each read on the date given (status V: the page was fetched and the number read from it). Standard citations of classic papers, entered by hand; awaiting Crossref verification (make verify, make apply-verify).
